# Any stray cross-compiled binary. `go build ./provider/` writes provider.exe
# under GOOS=windows (it cannot write "provider" -- that path is the source
# directory), and a 40MB artifact is easy to sweep in with `git add -A`.
# Deliberately not "/provider": that would ignore the source tree.
*.exe
